    <p style="text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;"><font style="background-color: #ffffff;"><b>Cautionary Note for U.S. Investors Concerning Mineral Resources and Reserves </b></font></p>
    <p style="text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;"><font style="background-color: #ffffff;">NI 43-101 is a rule of the Canadian Securities Administrators which establishes standards for all public disclosure an issuer makes of scientific and technical information concerning mineral projects. Technical disclosure contained in this news release has been prepared in accordance with NI 43-101 and the Canadian Institute of Mining, Metallurgy and Petroleum Classification System. These standards differ from the requirements of the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission ("<b>SEC</b>") and resource information contained in this news release may not be comparable to similar information disclosed by domestic United States companies subject to the SEC's reporting and disclosure requirements.</font></p>
